  "base": {
    "description": "the pin after scripts/cloudcli/apply-cs-locale.mjs and scripts/cloudcli/voice-overlay/apply-voice-overlay.mjs; every before hash below was measured on that tree on 2026-10-06 (U7 src/main.tsx + index.html, U8 the hook files, public/*, the icon set and the locale files). The Czech overlay writes src/modules/i18n/locales/cs/sidebar.json and common.json (from scripts/cloudcli/locale-cs/), so their before hashes are ITS output: a Czech translation fix in either file forces a brand re-cut (KTD5)",
    "recut": "at every pin bump, or when the Czech or voice overlay changes a file listed here: apply both earlier overlays to a fresh clone of the pin, then take each before hash from that tree and each after hash from the tree this script leaves; re-render the icon set with render-icons.mjs --tree <clone> only if lucide Brain or palette.css changed; re-measure each watched sha256 on that same tree, and if a watched file changed, re-check the pre-paint script and PARITY in scripts/cloudcli-brand-overlay.test.js against the new upstream rule first; update SOURCE_URL in files/src/brand/brandConfig.ts to the new version (brain-chat-v<version>) and re-push the fork branch (KD5)"
  },
